{"4464180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shogun's Stand", "steam_appid": 4464180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/540ed5c959c0996768da48180f22557b.avif?t=1787690172\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras_big/540ed5c959c0996768da48180f22557b.webp?t=1787690172 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Defend your tower. Survive the siege. Forge your legend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shogun's Stand</u> is a fast-paced <i>action tower defense rogue-lite</i> set in an under siege feudal Japan. You are the last defender, a lone Shogun standing at the heart of your castle as the relentless waves of enemies close in from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/b543cae56c10d308d9931a9c80a7f679.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/b543cae56c10d308d9931a9c80a7f679.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/b543cae56c10d308d9931a9c80a7f679.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of your tower's firepower, hold the line with loyal soldiers, lay cunning traps, fight along side your towers, and grow stronger with every wave you survive. No two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Way</strong><br>You don't just watch the battle unfold, you're in it! Rain down fire from your castle while building out your fortress, collecting Mon from fallen enemies to fund your defenses, and placing traps in real time. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/0a85bdd4a59d2ba9b055764b99809312.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/0a85bdd4a59d2ba9b055764b99809312.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/0a85bdd4a59d2ba9b055764b99809312.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Defense</strong><br>Spend your hard-earned Mon  to reinforce your position. Place soldier outposts to hold the front line, lay spike traps to punish advancing enemies, slow the horde with sand traps, and incinerate groups with flame towers. Block key chokepoints with barricades and watch your enemies try and break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up, Adapt, Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies earns experience. Each level up presents a choice of powerful upgrades to boost your firepower, multiply your collected Mon, power up defenses, or strengthen your Castle. Stack the right combinations and turn a desperate last stand into a devastating counteroffensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Relentless Threats</strong><br>Eight distinct enemy types will test every part of your strategy. Fast runners that strike true, armored tanks that shrug off arrows and tear down their opponents, explosive suicide bombers, ninjas that sneak up and attack from behind your lines, and terrifying mystics that teleport around the battlefield buffing enemies, cursing your towers, or summoning reinforcements from thin air. Not enough to fend off? Every ten waves a  Boss version appears to test your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/c9753f97150192825a61ce12478cc4ed.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/c9753f97150192825a61ce12478cc4ed.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/c9753f97150192825a61ce12478cc4ed.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Stand. Endless Replayability</strong><br>Randomized upgrades that can be rerolled if you feel lucky, escalating wave compositions, one of six map themes with random obstacles that are selected the instant you press start, and split decision making ensure that every run feels fresh. How long can you hold your enemies off? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct tower control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Shogun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique enemy types </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 tower types </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up system with stackable upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based progression with boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Mon, spend wisely, survive longer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/540ed5c959c0996768da48180f22557b.avif?t=1787690172\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras_big/540ed5c959c0996768da48180f22557b.webp?t=1787690172 width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Defend your tower. Survive the siege. Forge your legend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Shogun's Stand</u> is a fast-paced <i>action tower defense rogue-lite</i> set in an under siege feudal Japan. You are the last defender, a lone Shogun standing at the heart of your castle as the relentless waves of enemies close in from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut