 the horde with sand traps, and incinerate groups with flame towers. Block key chokepoints with barricades and watch your enemies try and break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/710a73c0dc8f8cb60a8386e86ddedc58.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up, Adapt, Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies earns experience. Each level up presents a choice of powerful upgrades to boost your firepower, multiply your collected Mon, power up defenses, or strengthen your Castle. Stack the right combinations and turn a desperate last stand into a devastating counteroffensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.poster.avif?t=1787690172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.webm?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464180/extras/4f6fe57061c6b5f9ff9204cb023cb415.mp4?t=1787690172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Relentless Threats</strong><br>Eight distinct enemy types will test every part of your strategy. Fast runners that 